    {
      "subId": "7081502",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Granny Ruoxin",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708150501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708150501": {
            "id": "708150501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Oh, where has that child run off to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150502"
            ]
          },
          "708150502": {
            "id": "708150502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Can I ask about Little Liu?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150503"
            ]
          },
          "708150503": {
            "id": "708150503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Are you looking for her? *sigh* What perfectly terrible timing. I don't know where's she's gone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150504"
            ]
          },
          "708150504": {
            "id": "708150504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "She received a letter that her father asked someone to send over from Liyue Harbor that stated that he'd be back soon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150505"
            ]
          },
          "708150505": {
            "id": "708150505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Little Liu was so happy. She said she wanted to prepare a gift for her father, and roped some other children into picking fruits and flowers...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150506"
            ]
          },
          "708150506": {
            "id": "708150506",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "But a few days afterward, he sent word, saying that he had a last-minute assignment and wouldn't be able to return.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150507"
            ]
          },
          "708150507": {
            "id": "708150507",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "She threw a tantrum, and nothing we said could dissuade her from insisting that she would go to Liyue Harbor herself, since her father wasn't coming.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150508"
            ]
          },
          "708150508": {
            "id": "708150508",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "We thought it a joke for a while. But this morning, she was gone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150509"
            ]
          },
          "708150509": {
            "id": "708150509",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "*sigh* We've already sent people out to look for her, but if you're willing, you can join in as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150511",
              "708150513"
            ]
          },
          "708150511": {
            "id": "708150511",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "I apologize for the trouble. *sigh* This child..."
          },
          "708150513": {
            "id": "708150513",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "I doubt she could go far. She's probably still close by, but the wilds are a dangerous place... Please, find her quickly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081503",
      "subQuestName": "Find Little Liu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081504",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all opponents",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708150401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708150401": {
            "id": "708150401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jiayi",
            "text": "*sigh* I was counting down the days before I'd be able to go back. Just two or three days more...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150402"
            ]
          },
          "708150402": {
            "id": "708150402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jiayi",
            "text": "With all the leave I've saved up until this point, I could have spent over a week together with Little Liu.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150403"
            ]
          },
          "708150403": {
            "id": "708150403",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jiayi",
            "text": "But with but one order, all our leaves were canceled. Even the people on leave were recalled.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150404"
            ]
          },
          "708150404": {
            "id": "708150404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jiayi",
            "text": "In my experience, this means at least another month without any hope of returning to Qingce Village. What terrible luck..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081505",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Little Liu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708150701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708150701": {
            "id": "708150701",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "Are you here to catch me and take me back to Qingce Village?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150703",
              "708150705"
            ]
          },
          "708150703": {
            "id": "708150703",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "Hmph. So you are here to catch me. Well, I'm not going back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150706"
            ]
          },
          "708150706": {
            "id": "708150706",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "Go back and tell the villagers that I'm going to Liyue Harbor to look for Daddy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150707"
            ]
          },
          "708150707": {
            "id": "708150707",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "They don't have to worry. Once I find him, I'll just talk to him for a while, then I'll come back."
          },
          "708150705": {
            "id": "708150705",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "I don't need anything from you. You're just trying to bribe me."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081506",
      "subQuestName": "Catch up to Little Liu (if she gets more than 30m away, the quest will be failed)",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708150601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708150601": {
            "id": "708150601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "That Jiayi, too. How could he just cancel on his daughter like that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150602"
            ]
          },
          "708150602": {
            "id": "708150602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "She doesn't see him any more than a few times a year. Is this how a father should behave?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150604",
              "708150606"
            ]
          },
          "708150604": {
            "id": "708150604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "That's what he says every year. I've lost count of the number of times he's said that..."
          },
          "708150606": {
            "id": "708150606",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Well, it's also his job to take care of his daughter. Little Liu is growing up day by day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150607"
            ]
          },
          "708150607": {
            "id": "708150607",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "If he's not careful, she'll be the one going out to work by the time he returns.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150608"
            ]
          },
          "708150608": {
            "id": "708150608",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "This father and his daughter just can't get together, can they?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081507",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all opponents",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081508",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Little Liu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708150801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708150801": {
            "id": "708150801",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "What are you following me for, anyway? I said, I'm going to Liyue Harbor!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150802"
            ]
          },
          "708150802": {
            "id": "708150802",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "I'll get around these monsters myself. They won't find me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150803"
            ]
          },
          "708150803": {
            "id": "708150803",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "Don't treat me like a kid! I'm a grown-up now!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150804"
            ]
          },
          "708150804": {
            "id": "708150804",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "This is from your father...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150805"
            ]
          },
          "708150805": {
            "id": "708150805",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "From Daddy? Did he ask you to send it over...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150806"
            ]
          },
          "708150806": {
            "id": "708150806",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "I'm sure it's more things for children to play with... if it's not kites, it's dolls.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150807"
            ]
          },
          "708150807": {
            "id": "708150807",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You don't like them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150808"
            ]
          },
          "708150808": {
            "id": "708150808",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "...I do. It's something Daddy gave me. How could I not like it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150809"
            ]
          },
          "708150809": {
            "id": "708150809",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "But if I always like these things, doesn't that mean that I'll always be a kid?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150810"
            ]
          },
          "708150810": {
            "id": "708150810",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "If I keep playing with them, when will I become an adventurer, or get my own Vision?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150811"
            ]
          },
          "708150811": {
            "id": "708150811",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What did you want a Vision for, again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150812"
            ]
          },
          "708150812": {
            "id": "708150812",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "If I had a Vision, I'd be able to do so many things, whether it be making money or something else...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150813"
            ]
          },
          "708150813": {
            "id": "708150813",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "Then, Daddy wouldn't have to work in Liyue Harbor all the time. He could come back and spend time with me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150814"
            ]
          },
          "708150814": {
            "id": "708150814",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "Right now, I can't even go to Liyue Harbor myself without a Vision...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150815"
            ]
          },
          "708150815": {
            "id": "708150815",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "But since Daddy has already sent you here with his presents, I might just be giving him more trouble by going to look for him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150816"
            ]
          },
          "708150816": {
            "id": "708150816",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "<color=#00E1FFFF>I had presents ready for him too</color>. I wanted to give him a surprise... But I can't take them to him now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150817"
            ]
          },
          "708150817": {
            "id": "708150817",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "<color=#00E1FFFF>If only someone could help me do that</color>... It's alright. I'm going back. There's no need to follow me, I know the way home."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081509",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Little Liu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708150901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708150901": {
            "id": "708150901",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "Dolls... kites... pinwheels. Daddy sent these again, just like I thought.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150902"
            ]
          },
          "708150902": {
            "id": "708150902",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "*sigh* It's just a shame that I wasn't able to send him my gifts too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150903"
            ]
          },
          "708150903": {
            "id": "708150903",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll take them to your father.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150904"
            ]
          },
          "708150904": {
            "id": "708150904",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "You'll help me? Well... Even though you don't have a Vision either, it looked like those monsters didn't give you a hard time at all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150905"
            ]
          },
          "708150905": {
            "id": "708150905",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "I guess we'll have to do it this way, then. Thank you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708150906"
            ]
          },
          "708150906": {
            "id": "708150906",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "*sigh* If only I could be as strong as you..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081510",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Jiayi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708151101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708151101": {
            "id": "708151101",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jiayi",
            "text": "Have you handed the presents to Little Liu yet?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708151103",
              "708151105"
            ]
          },
          "708151103": {
            "id": "708151103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jiayi",
            "text": "That's good. Those toys are her favorite. Thank you — please take these as a token of my thanks."
          },
          "708151105": {
            "id": "708151105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jiayi",
            "text": "I want to go back too. But with Liyue Harbor in this state, I don't think that's possible for the time being.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708151106"
            ]
          },
          "708151106": {
            "id": "708151106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jiayi",
            "text": "Still, thank you so much. I hope those presents will improve her mood a bit — they are her favorites, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708151107"
            ]
          },
          "708151107": {
            "id": "708151107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jiayi",
            "text": "Please, take this as thanks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081511",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Jiayi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708151201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708151201": {
            "id": "708151201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jiayi",
            "text": "Have you handed the presents to Little Liu yet?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708151202"
            ]
          },
          "708151202": {
            "id": "708151202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, this is from Little Liu.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708151203"
            ]
          },
          "708151203": {
            "id": "708151203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jiayi",
            "text": "This... is from Little Liu, for me? So many... How much work did she have to put in...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708151204"
            ]
          },
          "708151204": {
            "id": "708151204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jiayi",
            "text": "I want nothing more than to drop everything and run back to Qingce Village right now. But the Ministry of Civil Affairs would...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708151205"
            ]
          },
          "708151205": {
            "id": "708151205",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jiayi",
            "text": "Thank you once again. Take these as thanks, please.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708151206"
            ]
          },
          "708151206": {
            "id": "708151206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jiayi",
            "text": "*sigh* I have no idea when this whole affair will be over, or when the Ministry will approve my leave, either..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081510",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708151001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708151001": {
            "id": "708151001",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "You've returned. Thank you for your help. Little Liu has already returned, and with quite the bag of things, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708151002"
            ]
          },
          "708151002": {
            "id": "708151002",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Jiayi sent them to her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708151003"
            ]
          },
          "708151003": {
            "id": "708151003",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "Did he, now... But still, what Little Liu really wants is for him to come back in person.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708151004"
            ]
          },
          "708151004": {
            "id": "708151004",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "That child really has grown up like the bamboo around the village. Blink, and you'll miss just how much she's grown.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708151005"
            ]
          },
          "708151005": {
            "id": "708151005",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Granny Ruoxin",
            "text": "The days when your child is young will never return again once you miss them..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7081513",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708151301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708151301": {
            "id": "708151301",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "If only I had a Vision! With it, I could do so many things, whether it's making money or whatever...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708151302"
            ]
          },
          "708151302": {
            "id": "708151302",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "At least, I would have no trouble making it to Liyue on my own.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708151303"
            ]
          },
          "708151303": {
            "id": "708151303",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Little Liu",
            "text": "But, how do I get my hands on one..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}